 "name": "Focus",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/feature.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>At 2nd level, in battle, you fight with an unstoppable focus. On your turn, you can enter a focus as a bonus action. While focused, you gain the following benefits while not wearing heavy armor:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You have advantage on Strength checks and Strength saving throws.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You have resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You add your proficiency bonus to Strength based melee damage rolls.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your focus lasts for 1 minute. It ends early if you are knocked unconscious. You can also end your focus on your turn as a bonus action. You can focus a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus each long rest.  </p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
